@page
@model MossHarper.Pages.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Independent property advisory";
}

<section class="v17-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="v17-hero-copy">
        <p class="v17-eyebrow v17-eyebrow-gold">Independent property &amp; operational advisory</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">Expertise for complex property challenges.</h1>
        <span class="v17-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="v17-hero-lead">Senior-led advice for residential and mixed-use estates.</p>
        <p class="v17-hero-detail">Managing agent performance, service-charge scrutiny, building safety, operational transformation and complex property disputes.</p>
        <a class="v17-button v17-button-light" asp-page="/Contact" asp-fragment="contact">Discuss your challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="v17-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Contemporary residential building in warm evening light"></div>
</section>

<div class="v17-founder-strip">
    <div class="container v17-founder-inner"><span>Founder-led expertise</span><p><strong>Julian Harper-Brown, MTPI, AssocRICS</strong> · Former Managing Director and senior property executive with more than 18 years' experience across residential and large-scale mixed-use developments.</p></div>
</div>

<section class="v17-audience v17-section" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
    <div class="container v17-audience-grid">
        <div><p class="v17-eyebrow">Who we work with</p><h2 id="audience-title">Support for those responsible for complex property.</h2></div>
        <ul class="v17-audience-tags">
            <li>Developers &amp; investors</li><li>Freeholders &amp; asset owners</li><li>Managing agents &amp; property businesses</li><li>RMC &amp; RTM directors</li><li>Leaseholders &amp; resident groups</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="v17-pillars" aria-label="Areas of advice">
    <div class="container v17-pillars-grid">
        <div><h3>Property &amp;<br />operational advisory</h3><p>Independent reviews, performance improvement and operational risk management.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Strategic &amp;<br />commercial advisory</h3><p>Experienced judgement for complex decisions, asset owners, developers and investors.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Early dispute<br />assessment &amp; resolution</h3><p>Establish the facts. Address the cause. Avoid unnecessary escalation.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>
<p class="v17-statement">Clarity in complexity. Confidence in delivery.</p>

<section class="v17-services-overview v17-section" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="v17-section-intro"><div><p class="v17-eyebrow">Our services</p><h2 id="services-title">Where we can help.</h2><span class="v17-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div><p>Every property challenge has its own circumstances. We offer focused advice and practical support across the areas below, from independent assessment to carefully planned improvement.</p><a asp-page="/Services">Select a service to explore how Moss Harper may be able to assist. <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
        <div class="v17-service-links">
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="managing-agent"><span>01</span><strong>Independent Managing Agent &amp; Operational Reviews</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="service-charge"><span>02</span><strong>Service Charge Reviews &amp; Financial Performance</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="transformation"><span>03</span><strong>Strategic &amp; Operational Transformation</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="building-safety"><span>04</span><strong>Building Safety &amp; Regulatory Compliance</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="heat-networks"><span>05</span><strong>Heat Networks &amp; Utility Management</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="resident-engagement"><span>06</span><strong>Resident Engagement &amp; Communication</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="dispute-resolution"><span>07</span><strong>Early Dispute Assessment, Resolution &amp; Tribunal Support</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="approach" class="v17-approach v17-section" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="container"><p class="v17-eyebrow">Our approach</p><h2 id="approach-title">Assess. Advise. Deliver.</h2><p class="v17-section-lead">Clear thinking, proportionate recommendations and practical support to move from assessment to action.</p>
        <div class="v17-approach-grid">
            <div><span>01</span><h3>Assess</h3><p>Establish the facts, understand the underlying causes and evaluate operational, commercial, regulatory and reputational risks.</p></div>
            <div><span>02</span><h3>Advise</h3><p>Challenge assumptions where necessary and recommend realistic options, priorities, responsibilities and next steps.</p></div>
            <div><span>03</span><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Where commissioned, coordinate the right expertise, support implementation and provide oversight of agreed improvements.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="v17-why v17-section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container"><div class="v17-why-grid"><div><p class="v17-eyebrow">Why Moss Harper?</p><h2 id="why-title">Identifying the problem is only the beginning.</h2><span class="v17-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="v17-why-quote">The real value lies in knowing how to resolve it.</p></div><div><p>Complex property challenges rarely sit within a single professional discipline. They can involve operational failings, financial exposure, technical concerns, stakeholder relationships and reputational risk.</p><p>Clients work directly with senior-level experience, candid judgement and a willingness to challenge assumptions, even when the conclusions are uncomfortable.</p><p><strong>Drawing on established professional relationships, Moss Harper helps clients identify and engage appropriately qualified specialists, bringing together the experience and resources needed to deliver workable solutions.</strong></p></div></div>
        <div class="v17-independence"><p class="v17-eyebrow">Our independence</p><h3>Advice without hidden incentives.</h3><p>We do not accept referral fees, commissions or financial incentives from specialists we recommend. Recommendations are based on suitability, competence and the needs of the assignment.</p><p>We assess potential conflicts before accepting instructions and disclose relevant interests. Where we act for one party, our role is clear from the outset; that is distinct from acting as a neutral expert.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="leadership" class="v17-leadership v17-section" aria-labelledby="leadership-title">
    <div class="container v17-leadership-grid">
        <div><figure class="v17-portrait"><img src="~/images/julian-harper-brown.png" asp-append-version="true" width="1622" height="2048" alt="Julian Harper-Brown, founder of Moss Harper" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="v17-portrait-caption"><strong>Julian Harper-Brown</strong><span>MTPI · AssocRICS</span><span>Founder, Moss Harper</span></div></div>
        <div>
            <p class="v17-eyebrow">Experience &amp; leadership</p>
            <h2 id="leadership-title">Experience that makes a difference.</h2>
            <div class="v17-person-name"><strong>Julian Harper-Brown, MTPI, AssocRICS</strong><small>Founder | Moss Harper</small></div>
            <p>Moss Harper was established by Julian Harper-Brown, a former Managing Director and senior property executive with more than 18 years' experience across residential and large-scale mixed-use developments, including higher-risk residential buildings.</p>
            <p>Having held senior executive and client-side leadership appointments, including Head of Estates at Battersea Power Station, Julian brings extensive experience of managing complex property operations, leading multidisciplinary teams and overseeing substantial operational and service-charge budgets.</p>
            <p>His professional experience encompasses organisational restructuring, operational transformation, building safety and regulatory engagement, external-wall remediation, heat-network management, service-charge financial control, resident engagement and complex property disputes.</p>
            <p>Throughout his career, Julian has been directly responsible for reviewing management performance, identifying operational and commercial risks, implementing more efficient management structures and addressing challenging situations involving multiple stakeholders.</p>
            <p class="v17-bio-emphasis"><strong>This experience provides a practical understanding of how complex property operations function, where problems arise and what is required to deliver meaningful improvements.</strong></p>
            <p>Through Moss Harper, Julian applies that experience to provide independent, commercially informed advice to developers, freeholders, investors, property businesses and resident-led organisations.</p>
            <p>Where additional specialist expertise is required, he draws on established professional relationships to help clients identify appropriate resources and develop practical, proportionate solutions.</p>
            <a class="v17-text-link" asp-page="/Contact" asp-fragment="contact">Discuss your challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="v17-closing"><div class="container"><p class="v17-eyebrow v17-eyebrow-gold">Start a conversation</p><h2>What challenge are you trying to resolve?</h2><a class="v17-button v17-button-gold" asp-page="/Contact" asp-fragment="contact">Discuss your challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
